rrors'\\\\''])\nprint('\\\\''merged local alias'\\\\'',[(i['\\\\''kept'\\\\''],i['\\\\''duplicate'\\\\'']['\\\\''id'\\\\'']) for i in m['\\\\''unified'\\\\''] if '\\\\''dcq4'\\\\'' in i['\\\\''duplicate'\\\\'']['\\\\''id'\\\\'']])\n'\"","aggregated_output":"joint [('C3', 'FY2027 Q4 base: v9 has 2 forecasts (dcq4, dcq4_check); the comparison is ambiguous')]\nseparate alone [] []\nmerged []\nmerged local alias [('v9.dcq4', 'v9.dcq4_check')]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"NOT READY\n\n1. **The separate arm can pass a calculation the joint arm refuses.** I replayed the same R1 calculation both ways. C3 refused the joint answer for two Data Center Q4 forecasts. The separate merge silently removed one of those forecasts even though both came from the same answer. Unify only equivalent copies of declared shared forecasts across the two calls. Preserve duplicates within each call for the same checks to judge. [Merge](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py:293)\n\n2. **The packet key can still change the verdict after reading.** Changing one singleton’s key entry from `publish` to `held` flipped STOP to PASS without changing the run, packets, readings, or either checked digest. Seal the mapping before reading and verify each packet’s unit, draw, and decision against the frozen run. Use the run’s decision when counting defects. [Verdict](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py:526)\n\n3. **A valid abstention is impossible to grade, and earlier answers are still omitted.** An accepted unresolved singleton with no figures or citations generated an empty list of allowed grounds. Its readers cannot submit a valid reading, so a permitted abstention makes the run INCOMPLETE. The retry packet also listed the first refusal code without showing the answer that earned it. Give no-forecast cards an explicit way to cite their status and reason, and include each attempt’s answer or recorded failure. [Packet builder](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py:459) · [Ground validation](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py:498)\n\n4. **A torn journal entry prevents recovery of the whole run.** With a valid `started` record followed by a partial JSON line, `summarise()` raised `JSONDecodeError` and wrote no results. Preserve the committed entries, record the damaged tail as incomplete, and provide a read-only recovery path that reconstructs final statuses without sending again. [Journal reader and summary](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py:202)"}}
